{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人阮子曦於節目中推介中際旭創(3308)，看好公司受惠硅光光模組出貨增長，在向外擴展(Scale out)以外，拓闊至垂直擴展(Scale up)及跨資料中心擴展(Scale across)市場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">阮子曦建議現價即1161元買入，目標價1400元，止蝕價1050元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3325.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20262hEdnkrcc81789543342.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3325.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">阮子曦：中際旭創(3308)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入　$1161</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　$1400</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　$1050</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3326.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20268SWhWJfyhI1789543223.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3326.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人梁杰文推介石藥集團(1093)，指上半年業績理想，授權費收入急升，收入、利潤及派息增加，並憧憬旗下石藥創新A+H上市。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3323.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026FTc4ZTFQkG1789543378.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3323.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">梁杰文建議8.5元買入，目標價10元，止蝕價7.5元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">梁杰文：石藥集團(1093)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入　$8.5</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　$10</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　$7.5</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3324.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026gfSbiAew0n1789544660.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3324.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T08:19:35.871288+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}